 bert Thomas\, fflesh\, Slow Blink
DESCRIPTION:DIY experimental\, ambient\, drone and tape music at the reco
 rd shop Friday night. Artists from Chattanooga\, Indianapolis and Bloomin
 gton. No one turned away for lack of funds.\n\nSlow Blink - ambient sound
 s based in tape loops. slow-blink.bandcamp.com/ https://slow-blink.bandca
 mp.com/\n\nfflesh - soft noise/drone fflesh.bandcamp.com/ https://fflesh.
 bandcamp.com/\n\nWayne Robert Thomas is an Indianapolis-based artist whos
 e compositions refract infinitely\; bending time in those endless Midwest
 ern golden hours. waynerobertthomaswsr.bandcamp.com/ https://waynerobertt
 homaswsr.bandcamp.com/\n\nBlack Hole Drone Ensemble - Sounds From the Bla
 ck Hole house band
