SUMMARY: "Changing Colors" by Mary Ann Davis Exhibiton
DESCRIPTION:Experience the beauty of Indiana's landscapes and changing se
 asons in Changing Colors\, by acclaimed plein air painter Mary Ann Davis.
  Known for her vibrant use of color\, atmosphere\, and light\, Davis crea
 tes paintings that celebrate the natural world. Her work invites viewers 
 to slow down and appreciate the beauty found in everyday scenes.\n\nRecog
 nized as one of Indiana's premier plein air painters\, Davis has exhibite
 d widely\, earning distinction as a signature member of several prestigio
 us arts organizations. Her paintings have been featured in national publi
 cations such as Plein Air Magazine\, American Art Review\, Pastel Journal
 \, and Southwest Art. Changing Colors showcases the vibrant palettes and 
 observations that charm collectors and audiences alike.\n\n📅 Exhibition 
 Dates: July 2–31\n🎉 Artist Reception: Saturday\, July 18\n🕑 Reception T
 ime: 2:00–4:00 PM\n📍 Location: Arts Alliance Center\, College Mall\n🚗 F
 ree parking available\n\nJoin us for this special exhibition and meet the
  artist during the reception as we celebrate a collection of works that r
 eflect the color\, energy\, and beauty of the world around us.
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,Exhibition,Free,Gallery,In-Person,Visual-Arts
