SUMMARY: "Inside\, Outside" by Henry Leck & Carol Rhodes Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:Explore the relationship between the natural world and artist
 ic observation in Inside\, Outside\, a joint exhibition featuring Carol R
 hodes and Henry Leck. Drawing inspiration from landscapes\, outdoor space
 s\, and the beauty of everyday surroundings\, both artists bring distinct
  perspectives shaped by years of creative exploration. Together\, their w
 ork invites viewers to consider how we experience and interpret the world
  around us.\n\nRhodes' watercolor and gouache paintings are known for the
 ir luminous color\, fluid techniques\, and dreamlike quality\, while Leck
 's work reflects a deep appreciation for plein air painting and the artis
 tic community that has shaped his practice since retiring to Bloomington.
 \n\n📅 Exhibition Dates: July 3–August 26\n🎉 Artist Receptions: Friday\,
  July 3 and Friday\, August 7\n🕔 Reception Time: 5:00–8:00 PM\, during G
 allery Walk\n📍 Location: By Hand Gallery\, Fountain Square Mall\n\nJoin 
 us for Gallery Walk and meet the artists while exploring this thoughtful 
 collection of paintings inspired by both the world beyond our doors and t
 he creative landscapes within.
CATEGORIES:
