DESCRIPTION:THE “cult classic” comedy from the Monty Python team.\n\nHist
 ory is turned on its comic head when\, in tenth-century England\, King Ar
 thur (Graham Chapman) travels the countryside with his squire (Terry Gill
 iam) and his Knights of the Round Table (John Cleese\, Eric Idle\, Terry 
 Jones and Michael Palin)\, as they embark on a fearless quest in search o
 f the elusive Holy Grail.\n\nRated: PG\n\nLength: 1 hr 30 mins
